siriushq/netbsd_pkgsrcwip
=========================

This repository hosts a mirror of the pkgsrc-wip source code, available
in the `trunk` branch, retrieved from the official Git mirror of the
CVS repository, from the `master` upstream branch.

This repository is maintained to provide a Git workflow for forks and
other projects that depend on this source tree.  The `trunk` branch is
the exclusive tracking-branch for every dependent.
